 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "At Gibeon in the night the LORD came in a dream",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To a young king newly crowned and not yet sure of anything",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask what I should give you, said the LORD to Solomon",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the king looked at his hands, still a boy and not a man",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You were kind to David, my father, all his days",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you set his son upon his throne to walk in all his ways",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I am only a young man, I don't know how to go out or come in",
   "heard": 17,
   "words": 17,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Among a people so numerous they cannot be counted in",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give your servant a listening heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To judge your people",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To discern between good and evil",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not for gold and not for years",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give me ears to hear",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It pleased the LORD that Solomon had asked for this alone",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not for riches, not long life, not for enemies overthrown",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I give you a heart so wise and discerning, said the LORD",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And what you did not ask for, riches and honor, I will pour",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Give your servant a listening heart",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
